<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Utsav Booking</title>
    {{> styles }}
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
          <img src="https://i.imgur.com/SkOGGbd.png" alt="Company Logo">
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Utsav Booking Confirmed!</h1>
        <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
        <p>We are pleased to inform you that your booking has been successfully confirmed. Here are the details of your booking:</p>
        <div class="details">
          <p><strong>Booking ID:</strong> {{bookingid}}</p>
          <p><strong>Pachage Type:</strong> {{packageType}}</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p> <a href='https://aashray.vitraagvigyaan.org/files/rc_guidelines.pdf' target='_blank' class="link">Please click here</a> to read the guidelines for your stay at the Research Center. We hope you have a spiritually blissful stay.</p>
          <p>If you have any questions or need further assistance, please feel free to contact us at <b>+91-7875432613 / +91-9004273512</b>.</p>
        </div>  
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; 2025 SRATRC. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
